<section class="bde-f-container-2198-289 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-wrap"><div class="bde-f-container-2198-244 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-hero"><p class="bde-f-text-2198-241 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-stamp">
Last updated 21 September 2026
</p><h1 class="bde-f-text-2198-242 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h1">
Cookie Notice
</h1><p class="bde-f-text-2198-243 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-lede">
This notice lists every cookie nbasalaries.com sets, what each one is for and how long it lasts, along with the other domains your browser contacts. It sits alongside our Privacy Policy.
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2198-248 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-panel"><h2 class="bde-f-text-2198-245 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h2">
What a Cookie Is
</h2><p class="bde-f-text-2198-246 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
A cookie is a small text file a website asks your browser to store, so the site can recognise that browser on a later request. Some cookies are essential for a site to work. Others measure how a site is used, or support advertising. Under UK and EU rules a site may set strictly necessary cookies without asking, but needs your consent for anything else.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2198-247 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
This site sets four cookies in total. None of them are advertising cookies, and none are set by a third party.
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2198-268 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-panel-alt"><h2 class="bde-f-text-2198-249 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h2">
Cookies We Set
</h2><div class="bde-f-container-2198-266 bde-f-container nbasalarie-ck-grid"><div class="bde-f-container-2198-253 bde-f-container nbasalarie-ck-row"><p class="bde-f-text-2198-250 bde-f-text nbasalarie-ck-name">
PHPSESSID
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2198-251 bde-f-text nbasalarie-ck-desc">
Keeps your browsing session together as you move between pages. Set by the web server.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2198-252 bde-f-text nbasalarie-ck-meta">
Strictly necessary · Expires when you close your browser
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2198-257 bde-f-container nbasalarie-ck-row"><p class="bde-f-text-2198-254 bde-f-text nbasalarie-ck-name">
breakdance_last_session_id
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2198-255 bde-f-text nbasalarie-ck-desc">
Identifies the current visit so the page builder does not count it twice.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2198-256 bde-f-text nbasalarie-ck-meta">
Functional · Expires at the end of the session
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2198-261 bde-f-container nbasalarie-ck-row"><p class="bde-f-text-2198-258 bde-f-text nbasalarie-ck-name">
breakdance_session_count
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2198-259 bde-f-text nbasalarie-ck-desc">
Counts how many separate visits your browser has made to the site.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2198-260 bde-f-text nbasalarie-ck-meta">
Analytics · Expires after up to 1 year
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2198-265 bde-f-container nbasalarie-ck-row"><p class="bde-f-text-2198-262 bde-f-text nbasalarie-ck-name">
breakdance_view_count
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2198-263 bde-f-text nbasalarie-ck-desc">
Counts how many pages your browser has viewed on the site.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2198-264 bde-f-text nbasalarie-ck-meta">
Analytics · Expires after up to 1 year
</p></div></div><p class="bde-f-text-2198-267 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
The three beginning breakdance_ are set by Breakdance, the page builder this site is built with. They hold counts and a visit identifier, nothing else. They do not carry your name, your email address or anything you typed, they are not read by any third party, and they are not used to build a profile of you.
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2198-272 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-panel"><h2 class="bde-f-text-2198-269 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h2">
What We Do Not Set
</h2><p class="bde-f-text-2198-270 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
There is no advertising on this site, so there are no advertising cookies. We run no third party analytics product such as Google Analytics, so there is no analytics identifier shared with anyone. We use no social media pixels, no heatmap or session recording tools, and no fingerprinting.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2198-271 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
Because there is no behavioural tracking, a Do Not Track or Global Privacy Control signal has nothing here to switch off.
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2198-280 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-panel-alt"><h2 class="bde-f-text-2198-273 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h2">
Third Parties Your Browser Contacts
</h2><p class="bde-f-text-2198-274 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
Some files are served from other domains. Requesting a file from another domain reveals your IP address to it, whether or not a cookie is involved. None of these set a cookie on this site.
</p><div class="bde-f-container-2198-279 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-list"><p class="bde-f-text-2198-275 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-item">
Cloudflare sits in front of the site to speed it up and protect it from abuse.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2198-276 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-item">
Google Fonts supplies the typefaces. Google receives the request.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2198-277 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-item">
unpkg supplies an open source animation library used for page effects.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2198-278 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-item">
cdn.nba.com supplies official team logos and player headshots.
</p></div></div><div class="bde-f-container-2198-284 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-panel"><h2 class="bde-f-text-2198-281 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h2">
Controlling Cookies
</h2><p class="bde-f-text-2198-282 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
Every major browser lets you view, delete and block cookies by site, under a settings section usually called Privacy or Site Settings. Blocking the strictly necessary cookie may stop parts of the site working; blocking the three counters changes nothing you can see. Most browsers also offer a private mode that discards cookies when you close the window.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2198-283 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
Everything published on this site is readable with cookies blocked entirely.
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2198-288 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-panel-alt"><h2 class="bde-f-text-2198-285 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h2">
Changes
</h2><p class="bde-f-text-2198-286 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
This notice describes the site as it is today. We update it whenever the cookies on the site change, and change the date at the top.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2198-287 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
Questions can go through the <a class="nbasalarie-legal-link" href="/contact/">contact form</a>, and the wider picture is in our <a class="nbasalarie-legal-link" href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
</p></div></section>
